"\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Enables or disables the pipelining capability if the SMTP server supports it.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_MAILER__MAILER_NAME__PIPELINING+++[]\n"
